Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "name": "Invalid Quantity Product",
  "description": "Product with negative quantity",
  "price": 10.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "availableQuantity": -5
}

###

### 14. ❌ Створити товар з невалідною валютою
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/articles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "name": "Invalid Currency Product",
  "description": "Product with invalid currency",
  "price": 10.00,
  "currency": "INVALID",
  "availableQuantity": 5
}

###

### 15. ❌ Спробувати оновити неіснуючий товар
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/articles/999999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "name": "Non-existent Product",
  "description": "This product does not exist",
  "price": 10.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "availableQuantity": 5
}

###

### 16. ❌ Спробувати видалити неіснуючий товар
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/admin/articles/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

###

### 17. ❌ Спробувати отримати товар без токена (401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/articles

